  "fullDescription": "Get ready for the holiday season with This Cozy Vintage Christmas Watercolour Collection. This pack includes 10 digital watercolour tiles and 10 matching patterned background papers, all adorned with your favorite Christmas motifs like poinsettias, wreaths, and friendly birds.\n\nEach tile and paper brings a bit of nostalgic charm to whatever you’re creating. They’re perfect for adding a festive touch to your holiday cards, scrapbook pages, or any other project you’ve got in mind. These designs are digital, so you can use them again and again.\n\nThe collection is super easy to use and works great with most digital design tools. Whether you’re crafting for yourself, making something special for a friend, or even working on a commercial project, these patterns are here to add a little extra holiday cheer.\n\nWhat’s Inside:\n\n10 Watercolour Tiles with Vintage Christmas Designs\n10 Matching Patterned Background Papers\nDigital Format for Easy Use\nClassic Christmas Themes: Poinsettias, Wreaths, Robins, Cardinals\nGreat for Personal Projects or Commercial Work",
